OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA line of
OL,6,Ffairly heavy showers may form in
OL,7,Fnorthern parts of the region this
OL,8,Fevening, but otherwise any showers
OL,9,Fovernight will be isolated and light.
OL,10,FStaying dry, warm and humid in most
OL,11,Fareas but becoming breezier in coastal
OL,12,Fregions.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA mostly dry day with
OL,15,Fplenty of sunny spells. Isolated brief
OL,16,Flight showers are possible, mainly in
OL,17,Fthe north of the region. Much breezier
OL,18,Fand feeling considerably cooler than
OL,19,Frecently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
