OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FRemaining generally dry with a mixture
OL,7,Fof cloudy spells and periods of warm
OL,8,Fsunshine. Some cool nights and feeling
OL,9,Ffresher than of late, however
OL,10,Ftemperatures rising again into the
OL,11,Fweekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
